an Jose Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/sandalwood\\\">Sandalwood High</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/ssee\\\">Southside Estates Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/southside\\\">Southside Middle</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/springpark\\\">Spring Park Elementary</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\"},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"theme\":\"dark\",\"alternatingColors\":true}}]}],\"parentAccordionId\":\"2c3b0ddd-4ebe-4687-bf3d-71b714f2155b\"},{\"id\":\"1cd20d3e-383c-485d-b5f1-c5974a102d77\",\"name\":\"Accordion Panel\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_PANEL\",\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"text\":\"Photo Gallery\",\"panelExpanded\":true},\"nodes\":[{\"name\":\"Base Column\",\"type\":\"BASE_COLUMN\",\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"03c05f6f-28ee-49c7-8696-80466b417605\",\"name\":\"Gallery\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_GALLERY\",\"content\":{\"images\":[{\"name\":\"Image\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_IMAGE\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/4622089/c22a93a3-5b14-4e18-9ebd-e266aa389e92.png\",\"content\":{\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/4622089/c22a93a3-5b14-4e18-9ebd-e266aa389e92.png\",\"assetId\":4622089,\"altText\":\"Cindy Pearson and a male Board Member.\",\"caption\":\"\"},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"isDecorative\":false,\"naturalWidth\":1536,\"naturalHeight\":1536,\"focalPointPosition\":{\"x\":50,\"y\":50}}},{\"name\":\"Image\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_IMAGE\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/4622086/df94348f-d8a8-4729-a3a2-c9551cf902d5.png\",\"content\":{\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/4622086/df94348f-d8a8-4729-a3a2-c9551cf902d5.png\",\"assetId\":4622086,\"altText\":\"Cindy Pearson, a female teacher,  & female principal.\",\"caption\":\"\"},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"isDecorative\":false,\"naturalWidth\":4284,\"naturalHeight\":4284,\"focalPointPosition\":{\"x\":50,\"y\":50}}},{\"name\":\"Image\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_IMAGE\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/4622078/7c2594d5-d46e-4a8e-adbf-7599b7dd6f0c.jpeg\",\"content\":{\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/4622078/7c2594d5-d46e-4a8e-adbf-7599b7dd6f0c.jpeg\",\"assetId\":4622078,\"altText\":\"Cindy Pearson and a female teacher.\",\"caption\":\"\"},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"isDecorative\":false,\"naturalWidth\":0,\"naturalHeight\":0,\"focalPointPosition\":{\"x\":50,\"y\":50}}}]},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"columnsCount\":3,\"isLightbox\":false,\"showCaptions\":false,\"captionsAlignment\":\"center\"}},{\"id\":\"2929181e-a98f-4912-bcf3-c24e46bf69b4\",\"name\":\"Gallery\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_GALLERY\",\"content\":{\"images\":[{\"name\":\"Image\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_IMAGE\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/4622489/4f3ed400-14df-4a8e-9948-8b25e8cc0aef.jpeg\",\"content\":{\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/4622489/4f3ed400-14df-4a8e-9948-8b25e8cc0aef.jpeg\",\"assetId\":4622489,\"altText\":\"Cindy Pearson reading to a female teacher\",\"caption\":\"\"},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"isDecorative\":false,\"naturalWidth\":0,\"naturalHeight\":0,\"focalPointPosition\":{\"x\":50,\"y\":50}}}]},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"columnsCount\":1,\"isLightbox\":false,\"showCaptions\":false,\"captionsAlignment\":\"center\"}},{\"id\":\"7dd34759-0ce1-4fad-99bf-d665576a0fed\",\"name\":\"Gallery\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_GALLERY\",\"content\":{\"images\":[{\"name\":\"Image\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_IMAGE\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/4622513/6f5a1771-9242-47bc-be5d-a566951d6915.jpeg\",\"content\":{\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/4622513/6f5a1771-9242-47bc-be5d-a566951d6915.jpeg\",\"assetId\":4622513,\"altText\":\"Cindy Pearson and two females\",\"caption\":\"\"},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"isDecorative\":false,\"naturalWidth\":0,\"naturalHeight\":0,\"focalPointPosition\":{\"x\":50,\"y\":50}}},{\"name\":\"Image\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_IMAGE\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/5972405/1d0c229e-6bc2-469b-8e92-291aa3d7a3f3.jpeg\",\"content\":{\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/5972405/1d0c229e-6bc2-469b-8e92-291aa3d7a3f3.jpeg\",\"assetId\":5972405,\"altText\":\"People in yellow shirts stand around a sand pile spelling 'HOGAN'. A sign is behind them, and construction equipment is in the background.\",\"caption\":\"\"},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"isDecorative\":false,\"naturalWidth\":0,\"naturalHeight\":0,\"focalPointPosition\":{\"x\":50,\"y\":50}}}]},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"columnsCount\":1,\"isLightbox\":false,\"showCaptions\":false,\"captionsAlignment\":\"center\"}}]}],\"parentAccordionId\":\"2c3b0ddd-4ebe-4687-bf3d-71b714f2155b\"}]}]},{\"id\":\"882de8dd-04bc-42d4-8879-353f2de15712\",\"name\":\"Card\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_CARD\",\"content\":{\"heading\":{\"id\":\"cardTitle_882de8dd-04bc-42d4-8879-353f2de15712\",\"name\":\"Heading\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_HEADING\",\"content\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Darryl D. Willie</h3>\"},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[]}},\"text\":{\"id\":\"cardContent_882de8dd-04bc-42d4-8879-353f2de15712\",\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_TEXT\",\"content\":{\"html\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: left\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px\\\">Board Member</span></p><p style=\\\"text-align: left\\\">District 4</p><p style=\\\"text-align: left\\\"><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"mailto:WillieD@duvalschools.org\\\">Email Darryl Willie</a></p><p style=\\\"text-align: left\\\"><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"tel:+19043902374\\\">904-390-2374</a></p>\"},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[]}},\"image\":{\"name\":\"Image\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_IMAGE\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/3403894/f272f44b-8912-465d-a18b-54f9d524cca8.png\",\"content\":{\"assetUrl\":\"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/3403894/f272f44b-8912-465d-a18b-54f9d524cca8.png\",\"assetId\":3403894,\"altText\":\"Darryl Willie\"},\"properties\":{\"isDecorative\":false,\"naturalWidth\":445,\"naturalHeight\":445,\"focalPointPosition\":{\"x\":50,\"y\":50}}}},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"design\":\"box-shadow\",\"showImage\":true,\"showHeadline\":true,\"imagePosition\":\"left\",\"wrapText\":false,\"textCursor\":0,\"headlineCursor\":0}},{\"id\":\"a164711e-fd78-4aca-98bc-b293744d76f0\",\"name\":\"Accordion\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_ACCORDION\",\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"theme\":\"dark\",\"iconStyle\":\"caret\",\"allowMultipleOpenPanels\":true},\"nodes\":[{\"name\":\"Base Column\",\"type\":\"BASE_COLUMN\",\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"c677767a-bbcf-4b09-87ff-6a58536d11cd\",\"name\":\"Accordion Panel\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_PANEL\",\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"text\":\"About\",\"panelExpanded\":true},\"nodes\":[{\"name\":\"Base Column\",\"type\":\"BASE_COLUMN\",\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"3da8d2a0-6dc3-4b03-9d84-fd3b9d146543\",\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_TEXT\",\"content\":{\"html\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: left\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px\\\">Darryl Willie is a dynamic education ambassador with experience from K-12 to higher education. He has worked in education for the past 20 years from the front lines as a classroom teacher in the Mississippi Delta; to Education Administrator in California at UC Berkeley to Executive Director of Teach for America in Jacksonville. He has served on the Duval County School Board for 6 years and will serve through 2026. While on the board he has been a part of securing monumental funding for the rebuilding of neighborhood schools, successfully raising teacher salaries with a county-wide vote, and changing the names of confederate schools in the community.<br><br>Darryls’ work has been centered on impacting communities of color, with an intentional focus on sustainable outcomes for students and young adults. In addition to his school board role, Darryl also works as a non-profit leader and consultant in workforce development and education, developing community and business partnerships, managing strategic projects, accelerating and facilitating learning spaces across multiple cities and states. His work has not gone unnoticed as he was recognized as a Jacksonville Non-Profit Emerging leader, Leadership Jacksonville selection, School Board Partners National Fellow, Leadership Florida Education Class, and Jacksonville Business Journal top 40 under 40.<br><br>Darryl also serves on several local boards and has served on advisory boards for university presidents at two institutions. His community involvement includes the following: &nbsp;Northwest Jacksonville Community Development Corporation, Jacksonville Arts and Music School, Level the Playing Field, Jacksonville Zoo and Gardens, Alpha Phi Alpha Fraternity Inc, and 100 Black Men of Jacksonville.<br><br>Darryl is a proud military brat and has lived in many states and overseas. He attended North Carolina State University where he was Student Body President and holds a Masters Degree in Higher Education from the University of Georgia. Darryl lives on the Northside of Jacksonville with his brilliant and beautiful wife and his 3 inquisitive daughters.</span></p>\"},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[]}}]}],\"parentAccordionId\":\"a164711e-fd78-4aca-98bc-b293744d76f0\"},{\"id\":\"c8b60554-6a11-48f0-b22c-54dab6e72146\",\"name\":\"Accordion Panel\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_PANEL\",\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"text\":\"List of Schools\",\"panelExpanded\":true},\"nodes\":[{\"name\":\"Base Column\",\"type\":\"BASE_COLUMN\",\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"ab5fe87e-d57a-478c-90d7-fdf77c316a2f\",\"name\":\"Table\",\"type\":\"CONTENT_NODE_TABLE\",\"content\":{\"html\":\"<table style=\\\"width: 100%; min-width: 100px\\\"><colgroup><col style=\\\"min-width: 100px\\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" scope=\\\"col\\\"><p><strong>School Name</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/prhs\\\">A. Philip Randolph Career Academies</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/ajhs\\\">Andrew Jackson High</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/biscayne\\\">Biscayne Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/bshs\\\">Bridge to Success Academy High</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/dinsmore\\\">Dinsmore Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/fch\\\">First Coast High</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/gardencity\\\">Garden City Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/gpc\\\">Grand Park Education Center</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/hes\\\">Highlands Estates Academy</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/hms\\\">Highlands Middle</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/jrhs\\\">Jean Ribault High</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/jrms\\\">Jean Ribault Middle</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/longbranch\\\">Long Branch Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/northshore\\\">North Shore Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/nle\\\">Northwestern Legends Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/oceanway\\\">Oceanway Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/oceanwayschool\\\">Oceanway Middle</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/pes\\\">Pickett Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/rep\\\">Rufus E. Payne Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/rhp\\\">Rutledge H. Pearson Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/shes\\\">S.A. Hull Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/sbm\\\">Sallye B. Mathis Elementary</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/o/wmhs\\\">William M. Raines High</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\"},\"properties\":{\"anchorTag\":\"\",\"customClasses\":[],\"theme\":\"dark\",\"alternatingColors\":true}}]}],\"parentAccordionId\":\"a164711e-fd78-4aca-98bc-b2937