id":7139,"secondary_organization_id":22,"secondary_organization_ids":7140,"content":7141,"image":7142,"status":6,"style":7125,"display_location":7118,"featured":12},19128,[22,88,94,100,106,112,118,124,130,136,142,148,154,160,166,172,178,184,190,196,202,208,214,220,226,232,238,244,250,256,262,268,274,280,286,292,298,304,310,316,322,328,334,340,346,352,358,364,370,376,382,388,394,400,406,412,418,424,430,436,442,448,454,460,466,472,478,484,490,496,502,508,514,520,526,532,538,544,550,556,562,568,574,580,586,592,598,604,610,616,622,628,634,640,646,652,658,664,670,676,682,688,694,700,706,712,718,724,730,736,742,748,754,760,766,772,778,784,790,796,802,808,814,820,826,832,838,844,850,856,862,868,874,880,886,892,898,904,910,916,922,928,934,940,946,952,958,964,970,976,982,988,994,1000,1006],"\u003Cp>Given the possibility for unsafe conditions, Duval County Public Schools and district offices will be closed on Wednesday, Jan. 22. In addition, all athletics and after-school activities scheduled for Wednesday, Jan. 22 will be canceled.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Lastly, Tuesday's town hall at Chaffee Trail Middle has been rescheduled for Jan. 30.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>\u003C/p>\u003Cp>\u003C/p>",{"url":7143,"alt_text":7144,"asset_id":7145},"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/4181589/cb5008e0-45ef-49d5-801a-41d7d0d9489c.jpeg","Stormy Weather Ahead",4181589,{"id":7147,"secondary_organization_id":22,"secondary_organization_ids":7148,"content":7149,"image":7150,"status":6,"style":7125,"display_location":7112,"featured":12},24308,[22,94],"\u003Cp>New to Duval? Enroll your child today in Duval County Public Schools. Visit \u003Ca target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dcps.duvalschools.org/page/enrollment\">www.duvalschools.org/enroll\u003C/a> to learn more\u003C/p>",{"url":81,"alt_text":81},{"id":7152,"secondary_organization_id":22,"secondary_organization_ids":7153,"content":7154,"image":7155,"status":6,"style":7125,"display_location":7118,"featured":12},29109,[22],"\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Attendance = More Resources for Your Schools\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Did you know that strong student attendance not only boosts learning, but also brings more resources to your child’s school? Here’s why: state funding is directly tied to student enrollment. That means when more students are in school, our schools receive more support for staff, instructional materials, technology, and other essentials that benefit every student.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Between now and\u003C/strong> \u003Cstrong>October 10\u003C/strong>, we’ll be capturing each school’s enrollment to report to the state. Please make sure your child is in school every day during this time. Together, we can ensure our schools receive the resources they need to help students thrive!\u003C/p>",{"url":7156,"alt_text":7157,"asset_id":7158},"https://cmsv2-assets.apptegy.net/uploads/23734/file/5241009/5d3c8f12-4513-4967-94d4-efcbac11cdc7.jpeg","A student smiles as she types on a computer. ",5241009,{"id":7160,"secondary_organization_id":22,"secondary_organization_ids":7161,"content":7162,"image":7163,"status":6,"style":7111,"display_location":7118,"featured":12},29110,[22],"\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Attendance = More Resources for Your Schools\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Did you know that strong student attendance not only boosts learning, but also brings more resources to your child’s school? Here’s why: state funding is directly tied to student enrollment. That means when more students are in school, our schools receive more support for staff, instructional materials, technology, and other essentials that benefit every student.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Between now and \u003Cstrong>October 10\u003C/strong>, we’ll be capturing each school’s enrollment to report to the state. Please make sure your child is in school every day during this time. Together, we can ensure our schools receive the resources they need to help students thrive!\u003C/p>",{"url":81,"alt_text":81},["Emp